{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/heading_logo.png?t=1741653799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the Grove is a hybrid real-time tactics &amp; turn-based strategy roguelite where you, a young Grove Keeper, must venture out to face a mysterious corruption. With a steady stream of summoned mushroom warriors and crafted elemental golems by your side, rally your forces to battle across dozens of maps with varying objectives and discover the fate of the world beyond your grove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/heading_2.png?t=1741653799\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your army in a cycle of strategy and action. Take time to set your plan and create golems, then watch the battle unfold until your next chance to adapt. Rinse and repeat. Adjust your army\u2019s movements, tweak its composition, and outsmart your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/heading_3.png?t=1741653799\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and combine 7 elements as you play to create over 50 distinct golems, each with unique attacks. Discover their varied strengths and weaknesses as you craft your army.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/heading_4.png?t=1741653799\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master diverse synergies with more than 100 possible blessings to enhance your abilities and units. If your forces are overwhelmed, retreat to your grove to try again, keeping the knowledge and some of the power you've accumulated. Gather allies, explore the world, and defeat the corruption!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3516420?t=1741653799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/bd204744f678b19a4a4c667f00d14005f0634589/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741653799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/f15bf9572cb80ecadb0320445b685c015d56107e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741653799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/f15bf9572cb80ecadb0320445b685c015d56107e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741653799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/heading_logo.png?t=1741653799\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond the Grove is a hybrid real-time tactics &amp; turn-based strategy roguelite where you, a young Grove Keeper, must venture out to face a mysterious corruption. With a steady stream of summoned mushroom warriors and crafted elemental golems by your side, rally your forces to battle across dozens of maps with varying objectives and discover the fate of the world beyond your grove.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/heading_2.png?t=1741653799\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command your army in a cycle of strategy and action. Take time to set your plan and create golems, then watch the battle unfold until your next chance to adapt. Rinse and repeat. Adjust your army\u2019s movements, tweak its composition, and outsmart your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/heading_3.png?t=1741653799\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and combine 7 elements as you play to create over 50 distinct golems, each with unique attacks. Discover their varied strengths and weaknesses as you craft your army.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/extras/heading_4.png?t=1741653799\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master diverse synergies with more than 100 possible blessings to enhance your abilities and units. If your forces are overwhelmed, retreat to your grove to try again, keeping the knowledge and some of the power you've accumulated. Gather allies, explore the world, and defeat the corruption!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Neurodivergent Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3516420/b8e529c2780743e8e007cf935cf5a40b5ad50db0/header.jpg?t=1741653799","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Beyond the Grove","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> TBD<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBD</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul 